### Wallpaper API Tests
### Test the custom wallpaper upload and management functionality

### 1. Get all wallpapers (default + custom for user)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/chat/wallpapers?userId=test-user-123
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Upload a custom wallpaper
POST http://localhost:5000/api/chat/upload-wallpaper
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="custom-wallpaper.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-wallpaper.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="userId"

test-user-123
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

My Custom Wallpaper
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

A beautiful custom wallpaper for my chat
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

custom
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="supportsDark"

true
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="supportsLight"

true
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 3. Get custom wallpapers for a specific user
GET http://localhost:5000/api/chat/custom-wallpapers?userId=test-user-123
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Set wallpaper preference (using custom wallpaper)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/chat/preferences/wallpaper
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "me": "user1",
  "peer": "user2",
  "wallpaperId": "custom_12345-67890-abcdef",
  "opacity": 0.3
}

### 5. Get wallpaper preference
GET http://localhost:5000/api/chat/preferences/wallpaper?me=user1&peer=user2
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Delete custom wallpaper (replace with actual wallpaper ID from upload response)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/chat/custom-wallpapers/custom_12345-67890-abcdef?userId=test-user-123
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Test with default wallpaper
POST http://localhost:5000/api/chat/preferences/wallpaper
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "me": "user1",
  "peer": "user2",
  "wallpaperId": "abstract-aurora",
  "opacity": 0.25
}
